{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/5145d0c2a657d38a19bdfc102b2037f88afbf124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=1-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4b2d9bf61366954193f11080b4df2545b4c2a51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(g(x))=\\frac{1-x^2}{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"134\" height=\"39\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/5141b3b0adedf8965c49060e697689e88f77f6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\not=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d20f352ca7367ec16f9e17c5f2b7d183489b3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1/2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66ce9aa429037cc764a3ba8b3f16cbe2cd78904a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 3/4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\sqrt{2}/2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"409\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that if we can find a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/1284913fbbd8f4888308dda73411f0b02b69ba46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(y)=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" />, then we can plug that into the second equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b665f12e3c9fcf50ce79343b377a006d62e901b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=f(g(y))=\\frac{1-y^2}{y^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"210\" height=\"43\" />. Thus, we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206ced8006691794d2f03f91872631198b1c9a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-y^2=\\frac{1}{2}\\implies y^2=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"188\" height=\"37\" />. Notice that, since our final expression only involves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a3faa3658bcbd8bde8e16cfa5baf019619fc9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" />, we don't need to take the square root. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b65b2959ef560232e2679c663ca447964a5d09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{1-y^2}{y^2}=\\frac{1-\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}}=1, \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"264\" height=\"47\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"backgroun